{"id":"H3281","lemma":"יַעְלָם","transliteration":"yalam","sayIt":"ya-LAM","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Jalam","meaning":"A man of the Edomites living at the time of the Patriarchs, first mentioned at Gen.36.5;\nson of: Esau (H6215) and Oholibamah (H0173);\nbrother of: Jeush (H3266) and Korah (H7141);\nhalf-brother of: Eliphaz (H0464) and Reuel (H7467)\n§ Jaalam = \"concealed\"\nan Edomite, descendant of Esau","glosses":["jalam"],"count":4,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"gen-36","v":5,"renderings":{"bsb":"Jalam","kjv":"and Jaalam"}},{"chapterId":"gen-36","v":14,"renderings":{"bsb":"Jalam","kjv":"and Jaalam"}},{"chapterId":"gen-36","v":18,"renderings":{"bsb":"Jalam","kjv":"Jaalam"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-1","v":35,"renderings":{"bsb":"Jalam","kjv":"and Jaalam"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"Genesis 36:5","note":"Oholibamah bore Jeush, Jalam, and Korah. These are the sons of Esau, who were born to him in the land of Canaan.","source":"web"},{"ref":"1 Chronicles 1:35","note":"The sons of Esau: Eliphaz, Reuel, Jeush, Jalam, and Korah.","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H0173","lemma":"אׇהֳלִיבָמָה","transliteration":"oholivamah","gloss":"Oholibamah"},{"id":"H0464","lemma":"אֱלִיפַז","transliteration":"eliphaz","gloss":"Eliphaz"},{"id":"H3266","lemma":"יְעוּשׁ","transliteration":"yeush","gloss":"Jeush"},{"id":"H6215","lemma":"עֵשָׂו","transliteration":"esav","gloss":"Esau"},{"id":"H7141","lemma":"קֹ֫רַח","transliteration":"qorach","gloss":"Korah"},{"id":"H7467","lemma":"רְעוּאֵל","transliteration":"reuel","gloss":"Reuel"},{"id":"H0123","lemma":"אֱדוֹם","transliteration":"edom","gloss":"Edom"},{"id":"H3274","lemma":"יְעִישׁ","transliteration":"yeish","gloss":"Jeush"}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}